        <profile name="Rapturous Blows" id="6aee-e941-5d84-a046" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Until the end of the phase:
  - When this unit is selected to fight, you can use this ability: spend 1 Miracle die.
  - Each time an attack made by this model scores a wound, while making melee attacks, the target suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
