          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of each phase, you can use this ability, once per battle per unit, select one friendly ADEPTA SORORITAS unit that is Battle-shocked and within 12" of this model. That unit is no longer Battle-shocked.</characteristic>
