        <profile name="Abbess Sanctorum" id="9110-0ee6-ee0f-0a41" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit:
  - You can re-roll Hit rolls.
  - You can re-roll Wound rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="f0dd-ac69-9165-5062" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Righteous Repugnance" id="1783-934e-0906-1473" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this unit is selected to shoot, you can use this ability or when this unit is selected to fight, you can use this ability, until the end of the phase:
  - Spend 1 Miracle die.
  - Add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of Fidelis weapons equipped by models in this unit.
  - Add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of Lance of Illumination weapons equipped by models in this unit.
Each time this model destroys an enemy unit, you gain 1 Miracle die.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Supreme Commander" id="a43e-10d4-7704-13b1" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is friendly, this unit must be your Warlord.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="141b-cbf7-46fa-a915" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves, roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while this unit is within 6" of this model, that unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
