    <selectionEntry name="Daemonifuge" id="8569-2390-d4db-30fd" hidden="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="26bb-da3b-729b-5263" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Fights First" id="6b81-4ea7-9ad5-7ac0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this unit has the Fights First ability, this unit gains the Fights First ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Holy Judgement" id="6f8c-2707-fbe5-369e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Shooting phase, until the end of the phase:
  - Select one enemy unit that is within 12" of this model and visible to this model:
    - If the selected unit has the CHAOS keyword, that unit must take a Battle-shock test, applying -2 to that test.
    - Unless the selected unit has the CHAOS keyword, that unit must take a Battle-shock test.
    - If the triggering battle shock roll was a failure, that unit suffers 3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lone Operative" id="f067-61a7-ee75-3175" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Enemy units cannot target this model with ranged weapons unless the attacking unit is within 12".</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Mysterious Saviours" id="980d-0f43-57b5-b6f7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can use this ability: This unit is eligible to be targeted with the Heroic Intervention Stratagem even if it has already been targeted with that Stratagem this phase.
Reduce the CP cost of that use of the Stratagem by 1 CP, to a minimum of 0 CP.
This unit's Heroic Intervention ability has no limit on its number of uses, and this use does not count toward that ability's limit for other units.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="a827-de2f-fd39-8fe9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this unit ends an Ingress move, while this unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
