        <profile name="Fiery Conviction" id="0363-119b-7cc7-2cbd" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Command phase, you can use this ability, while this model is on the battlefield, until the end of the phase:
  Choose one of the following:
    - Spend 1 Miracle die; you gain 1 CP.
    - This model must take a Leadership test; if the triggering leadership roll succeeded, you gain 1 CP.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="352f-33e2-c3d2-2f8d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="The Pulpit of Saint Holline's Basilica" id="03da-5c14-9396-97d6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While making melee attacks, this unit gains the Stealth ability.
Against melee attacks, subtract 1 from the attacking unit's Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="94ca-7f5c-7170-10e7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves, roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while this unit is within 6" of this model, that unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
