          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this unit is selected to fight, until the end of the phase:
  - Unless this unit charged this turn:
    Choose one of the following:
      - Melee weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1].
      - Melee weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [LETHAL HITS].
  - If this unit charged this turn, melee weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1] and [LETHAL HITS].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="5385-0514-fa93-1133" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this unit ends an Ingress move, while this unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
