                <rule name="Angelic Judgement" id="2d11-90a2-fe9b-2d7f" hidden="false">
                  <description>Friendly ADEPTA SORORITAS FLY INFANTRY units gain the Condemnatory Psalms ability:
  - Until the end of the phase, you can: during your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit visible to this model that is within 12" of this unit; that unit is Condemned; while the selected unit is Condemned, add 3" to that unit's detection range.
