                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Improve the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by this model by 1.
Improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by this model by 1.
Melee weapons equipped by this model gain [PRECISION].
